    subtitle="综合技术文档、工程指南、白皮书和可下载 CAD 资源 — 面向钛材制造专业人士的开放知识库。"
  />

  <!-- Resource Hub Matrix -->
  <ResourceHubMatrix />

  <!-- Featured Insights -->
  <FeaturedInsights />

  <!-- Engineering Downloads -->
  <EngineeringDownloads />

  <!-- Technical FAQ Accordion -->
  <TechnicalFaqAccordion />
